    "title": "INBOUND 2024",
    "description": "Discover the official mobile app for HubSpot\u2019s INBOUND conference, the ultimate event for marketing, sales, customer service, and business growth professionals. From September 18-20, 2024 in Boston, join industry leaders, innovators, and trailblazers at INBOUND to explore the latest trends, tools, and tactics driving the future of business.\r\n\r\nWith the INBOUND 2024 mobile app, you can:\r\n- View the full agenda and favorite your top picks\r\n- Save your seat for capacity-capped sessions\r\n- Find your way around the Boston Convention & Exhibition Center\r\n- Stay in the know with real-time updates\r\n\r\nMake the most out of your INBOUND experience and download the app today!",
